From fc571945a68d33ec3a98b98013b80818955d2c1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YorokobiMaster <50650009+YorokobiMaster@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 09:56:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] display: add optional device ambient and brightness cap
 policies

Keep ABC sensor ownership, native mapping and a single evaluation timer. Route device nits ceilings through the native clamper and preserve legacy HDR limits. Load policies only for the default internal display; an unavailable configured policy retains the normal brightness ceiling.

Change-Id: I108a3143c1bf6723594319ce5c221cc99ce307ae
